[18.572587, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ parses a signature header with two v1 entries \u001b[90m(1.354734ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ accepts a correctly signed body \u001b[90m(4.339244ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[31m✖ rejects a body signed with the wrong secret \u001b[90m(6.638725ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[31m✖ rejects a stale timestamp \u001b[90m(0.456931ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ policy: small INR refunds auto-approve, others go to review \u001b[90m(0.32123ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[18.574267, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ cancelling a pending refund \u001b[90m(3.441116ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
